    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on a collapsing planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live each day on a gray planet, chatting with friends, watering flowers, and doing other daily things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gray Planet] is an exploration adventure game about living on a collapsing planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various objects, avoid enemies, and explore the ruined planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605\u2606\u2605\u2606</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-oriented</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the space bar to explore the surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get hints by exploring specific objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing time: Approximately 30 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be a follow-up chapter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure story of Big Dipper and Naive</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up, down, left, and right keys: Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X button: Menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space bar: Decide, investigate</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on a collapsing planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live each day on a gray planet, chatting with friends, watering flowers, and doing other daily things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gray Planet] is an exploration adventure game about living on a collapsing planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various objects, avoid enemies, and explore the ruined planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605\u2606\u2605\u2606</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-oriented</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the space bar to explore the surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get hints by exploring specific objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing time: Approximately 30 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be a follow-up chapter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure story of Big Dipper and Naive</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up, down, left, and right keys: Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X button: Menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space bar: Decide, investigate</p></li></ul>",
